00:13:55.580 --> 00:13:57.690
So once you acquire
all the data,

00:13:57.690 --> 00:14:01.160
including the device
data, telemetry data,

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:05.270
data from manufacturers,
could be FMEA,

00:14:05.270 --> 00:14:09.890
